          // 2. Src sees dst_ready, asserts dst_valid.
          // 3. Dst sees dst_valid & dst_ready, consumes data, deasserts dst_valid.
          // 4. Dst asserts dst_ready.
          // 5. Src sees dst_ready, deasserts dst_valid (goes to IDLE).

